OL,3,AMicrosoft users report outages amid
OL,4,Atech giant 'connectivity issues'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft says it is working to tackle
OL,7,F"connectivity problems" after users
OL,8,Fworldwide reported outages on Thursday.
OL,10,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,11,FMicrosoft's AI software Copilot were
OL,12,Faffected.
OL,14,FThe tech giant said a part of its
OL,15,Finfrastructure was experiencing
OL,16,F"elevated load", which was likely
OL,17,Fcontributing to connectivity errors.
OL,19,FWhile the issue was originally reported
OL,20,Fin the US, Microsoft said the
OL,21,Fconnectivity problems could affect
OL,22,Fusers "in any region".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
